#: terra/templates/terra/health.html:55
msgid ""
"The colony's health band: continuous heart rate and blood oxygen,\n"
"            sleep and step tracking, heat-strain warnings during the "
"current\n"
"            warm spell, and a one-press beacon that opens Terra Chat with "
"your\n"
"            vitals attached. 50 TRX, one payment, yours for the expedition."
